---
layout: base.njk
title: Kontakt
description: Schreib uns – wir freuen uns von dir zu hören.
permalink: /kontakt/
---

<div class="contact-wrap">
  <div class="contact-hero">
    <h1>Kontakt</h1>
    <p>Hast du eine Geschichte zu teilen, eine Frage oder ein Feedback? Schreib uns.</p>
  </div>
  <form class="contact-form" id="contactForm">
    <div class="form-group">
      <label class="form-label">Dein Name</label>
      <input class="form-input" type="text" placeholder="Max Mustermann" required>
    </div>
    <div class="form-group">
      <label class="form-label">E-Mail-Adresse</label>
      <input class="form-input" type="email" placeholder="deine@email.de" required>
    </div>
    <div class="form-group">
      <label class="form-label">Betreff</label>
      <input class="form-input" type="text" placeholder="Worum geht es?">
    </div>
    <div class="form-group">
      <label class="form-label">Nachricht</label>
      <textarea class="form-textarea" placeholder="Schreib uns deine Nachricht..." required></textarea>
    </div>
    <button class="form-submit" type="submit">Nachricht senden →</button>
  </form>
  <div class="contact-info">
    <div class="info-card">
      <div class="icon">📧</div>
      <h4>E-Mail</h4>
      <p>hallo@herzwelt.de</p>
    </div>
    <div class="info-card">
      <div class="icon">⏱️</div>
      <h4>Antwortzeit</h4>
      <p>Innerhalb von 24 Stunden</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
